    "Compact differs from Base only in section padding (8.5rem vs 13.4375rem on desktop), set as variant styles at main, medium and small; the crops show the same cards and type",
    "Different content per instance (rooms-individual) is props, not CMS; rooms-individual could bind to the Rooms collection later",
    "Six cards with Show card 4 to 6; Figma shows three and a half cards, so cards 4 to 6 are placeholder labels linking to site pages",
    "Images are grey #d9d9d9 slots by default (Show image N off); Image N props take an asset id",
    "Card stagger (tall, square, mid) is fixed per card position through is-tall and is-mid combos, repeating every three cards",
    "Gap comes from the slide's CSS margin-right; Swiper runs with spaceBetween 0, because Swiper measures margins in slidesPerView auto and a non-zero spaceBetween doubled the gap",
